# November 25, 2026: Johnson County, Kansas, fifth pass: the old downtowns of Edgerton and De Soto, Old Town Lenexa and
# two Olathe churches. The county's National Register lists were used up by earlier batches, so these come from the
# Kansas Historical Society's 2009 Johnson County survey report, the Johnson County Library's own pages for the Edgerton
# branch, and the Lenexa Historical Society's pages for the Strang Line waiting station.
